# Test fakes and doubles

## Required

1. Put Fake/Dummy doubles under `**/tests/fakes/` (one class per file, no nested classes)
2. Do not define collaborator Fake classes inside `test_*.py` / `*_test_support.py` (pytest `Test*` classes are fine)
3. Inject ports / fakes at construction — do **not** `monkeypatch.setattr` a collaborator (`os`, `time`, internal module) to stub I/O
4. Prefer complete fakes that implement the real Protocol/ABC contract

## Smell → fix

| Smell | Fix |
|-------|-----|
| Inline `class FakeX` in a test module | Move to `tests/fakes/fake_x.py` |
| `monkeypatch.setattr(service, "_client", …)` | Inject `HttpClient` in the constructor |
| Incomplete fake missing a method used in prod | Expand the fake; do not catch `AttributeError` |
